# Wave 53 §T — the operator, Playtest 9: *"cards like 'Magus of the moon' and
# 'Urborg tomb of yawgmoth' change the types of cards … put one of our overlay
# pills over the type bar."* Seat 0 (human) controls Urborg, Tomb of
# Yawgmoth and a Plains, an uncontested turn-1 Main Phase 1 — nothing to cast,
# nothing to decide, just the board as it stands after Urborg resolves.
# Urborg's own text (`AddType$ Swamp`, no `RemoveLandTypes`) ADDS Swamp
# alongside Plains's own type: the wire's current type line for the Plains
# becomes "Basic Land — Plains Swamp", against its printed "Basic Land —
# Plains" (`adapter.ts`'s `BASIC_LAND_TYPE_LINES` — a basic's printed type
# line is not cube data, so it is not in `pool.json`).
